e mutually exclusive alternatives.\\n  - When inserting/splitting siblings, update each sibling's `notes` with a short `SELF_CHECK` line explaining why it excludes its siblings.\\n- Sibling constraint (CRITICAL): do NOT keep \\\"baseline\\\" and \\\"optimized\\\" variants of the SAME design as siblings.\\n  - If an action is a refinement/optimization of another, make it a CHILD under that node.\\n- Kernel families: top-level family nodes (root children) represent end-to-end mapping/ownership plans.\\n  Do NOT name families after tactics; tactics belong in deeper nodes or leaf action notes.\\n\\nOutput JSON with this shape:\\n{\\n  \\\"active_leaf_id\\\": \\\"optional node_id\\\",\\n  \\\"ops\\\": [\\n    {\\\"op\\\":\\\"update_node\\\",\\\"node_id\\\":\\\"...\\\",\\\"patch\\\":{...}},\\n    {\\\"op\\\":\\\"insert_node\\\",\\\"parent_id\\\":\\\"...\\\",\\\"parent_solution_id\\\":\\\"(required if parent has solution)\\\",\\\"node\\\":{...}},\\n    {\\\"op\\\":\\\"split_node\\\",\\\"node_id\\\":\\\"...\\\",\\\"parent_patch\\\":{...},\\\"children\\\":[{...}, ...]}\\n  ]\\n}\\n\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.3-codex\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}"}}, "request_meta": {"model": "gpt-5.3-codex", "reasoning": {"effort": "high"}}, "response": {"http_version": "HTTP/1.1", "headers": [["Date", "Thu, 12 Mar 2026 06:49:24 GMT"], ["Content-Type", "application/json"], ["Transfer-Encoding", "chunked"], ["Connection", "keep-alive"], ["Server", "cloudflare"], ["x-ratelimit-limit-requests", "15000"], ["x-ratelimit-limit-tokens", "40000000"], ["x-ratelimit-remaining-requests", "14999"], ["x-ratelimit-remaining-tokens", "39995667"], ["x-ratelimit-reset-requests", "4ms"], ["x-ratelimit-reset-tokens", "6ms"], ["openai-version", "2020-10-01"], ["openai-organization", "user-gkecbvpi5qhvhyambwxpr8fh"], ["openai-project", "proj_EkbW0zlnFODIW5wl4jG2vWR3"], ["x-request-id", "req_77cdf0b69e6944a19f932927b565f82f"], ["openai-processing-ms", "72628"], ["cf-cache-status", "DYNAMIC"], ["X-Content-Type-O